OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGMINERS URGE SCARGILL
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGTO SEEK RE-ELECTION
OL,5, South Wales miners have urged Arthur
OL,6, Scargill, president of the National
OL,7, Union of Mineworkers, to stand down.
OL,9,FThey said Mr Scargill and union
OL,10,Fofficial Peter Heathfield should seek
OL,11,Fre-election.
OL,13,FThey also voted unanimously in favour
OL,14,Fof #700,000 donated to the NUM by
OL,15,FSoviet miners to be returned to them.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FSouth Wales NUM officials are expected
OL,18,Fto raise the question of an election
OL,19,Fat a special delegate conference of
OL,20,Fcoalfield leaders scheduled for October
OL,23,D]FFromG15-09-90F  teletextarchive.com
